WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.568 size:75% position:38%
-"The Tonight Show"!
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is no joke.
Guys, I did it.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.606 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:07.741 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hi.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:08.708 line:92%
Okay, guys, are you ready?

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:11.378
I only have a few minutes
and it's very important

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:13.513 line:92%
what I have to say, to me.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.882 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Um...

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:16.649 line:92%
I want to feel you though.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.084 size:78% position:39%
You know what I mean?
I want to feel you.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers ]
Yes, okay.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.789 line:92%
Okay, but -- yes, thank you.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I want to talk to you guys
about french fries

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.161 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for a few minutes.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.964
And I humbly request that you
sort of settle into the topic,

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:34.300
because it will be filling
the rest of my time here.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.635 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:38.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I love fries.
Okay?

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:41.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.575 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I love fries.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:43.276 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What I don't love

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:46.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
is the way people
behave around them.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:49.649
I've noticed the tendency
for people go like this --

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:52.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
They go,
"Can I steal a few fries?"

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.220 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.990 line:92%
"Can I steal a couple fries?"

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.958 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's wrong.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.427 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's like, no!

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:05.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
Excuse me, I had the courage
when the waiter was here.

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.435 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
When reputations
were on the line,

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.239 line:92%
I spoke up for my desires.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:16.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, "Yes,
make my burger deluxe."

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.745 line:92%
You did not have such courage.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:22.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's what it is,
I ordered a dream come true,

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.384 line:92%
and you ordered a Greek salad.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:25.218 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:29.489
You made your bed our lettuce
and you need to live in it

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:31.357 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and lie in it, hungry.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
You need to suffer
for your choices.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:38.198 line:92%
[ Inhales, exhales deeply ]

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:39.599 size:88% position:44% line:92%
The issue is this, okay?

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.401 size:78% position:39%
People have all sorts
of sinister tactics

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they use when they're
coming for your fries.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.505 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Okay, this is a classic.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sometimes during
the ordering process,

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
a friend will go like this.
They'll go,

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I think I'm going to get
the Greek salad

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:53.179 size:81% position:41%
as long as I can steal
a few of your fries."

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.215 line:92%
Boom -- they close the menu.

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
They try to sneak
it in really fast.

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:59.052 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Little caveat.

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:00.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
They think you won't
have the courage

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:03.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
to do what you must do,
which is to say,

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Looks like we're not
ready to order."

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:07.560 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.496 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And reopen the menu.

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
Looks like you need
to take a minute

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
to think about what you
really desire and, frankly,

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.368
what kind of person you
really want to be in this life.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.002 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.704
And I have to go back in,
because I have to order

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:20.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
some compensatory items,
because it's clear

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:23.209 size:78% position:39%
that you'll be coming
for my harvest later.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.912 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:27.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:30.350 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.520
My real problem --
my real problem is these people,

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.588
they always use the word steal.
Okay?

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.756 line:92%
They go, "can I steal a fry?"

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:38.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's always steal,
and what they're doing,

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.560 line:92%
it is sick and manipulative.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.227 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
What they're doing
is they're overexaggerating

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.931 size:84% position:42% line:92%
the scope of the crime,

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:48.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
so that you look like
the monster if you refuse.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:49.602 size:75% position:38% line:92%
How can you respond?

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:50.970 line:92%
"Can I steal a few fries?"

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.672 size:78% position:39% line:92%
"No, theft is wrong."

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:53.973 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a real --
it's a real problem.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:03:00.046
I'll tell you that any time
anyone steals a curly fry,

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:03.716
somehow it always ends up being
the longest one in the bunch.

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:04.751 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:07.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they act innocent.
I know the excuses.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've used them myself
in darker days.

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
"In that tangle of curls?
I had no idea.

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:14.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just grabbed an end
and pulled."

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:15.662 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Exactly.

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:18.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you can't see both ends
of a curly fry,

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.766 line:92%
it doesn't belong to you.

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:22.602 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:25.104 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
Some people are surprised.
No, they are.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:30.443
They're surprised,
given my militancy around fries,

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:33.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
to find out that I love to see
a rogue onion ring

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:35.014 line:92%
end up on my plate. I do.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:37.517
I do, because it suggests to me
the right kind of spirit

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:39.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
happening back in the kitchen.
Okay?

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.654 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:43.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
When they're getting my fries,
you know,

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:45.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
the chef's kind of -- this is
what I imagine, at least.

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:49.762 line:92%
This kind of thing -- Hey.

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:53.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey. you know, kind of a lose,
generous basket-work

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.400 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
that I appreciate.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.237 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you guys want to know
my absolute

00:03:58.705 --> 00:04:00.873 line:92%
favorite way to get fries?

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:02.875 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Laughs ] It's alone.

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:05.845 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like to --
I like to go to the diner

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:14.287
and I like to sit in the booth
with the busted seat spring,

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:19.759
so I'm unnaturally low,
peering impossibly at the plate.

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:24.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I get a big plate
of fries and just a soda.

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.267 line:92%
What I'm trying to say --

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like to eat fries
like I'm a little kid

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:31.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's being held
at the police station.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:33.606 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:35.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because my parents
were found slaughtered

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
by a serial killer
earlier that day.

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.647 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd been there for hours,
you know?

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:45.785 line:92%
And finally someone was like,

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:48.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Someone's gotta get the kid
something to eat."

00:04:48.288 --> 00:04:50.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they were like, "Delillo,
fries and a sodie pop,

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:52.659 size:78% position:39% line:92%
handle it!" You know?

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:55.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:59.899
So I like to eat them with a
kind of traumatized innocence.

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:01.968 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know --

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:04.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:06.439 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just kind of dazed.

00:05:06.439 --> 00:05:09.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
I like to eat my fries
inscrutably.

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
So if the detective
were to peer in at me,

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:15.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
he might remark to his partner
something like,

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:17.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You think he even knows
his life's about to change?"

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:21.054 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.525 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:28.428
I'm a little boy in the fantasy
and I don't know why.

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.129 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's --

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:32.065 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.065 --> 00:05:34.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know, he comes in
to take my statement. Right?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, he wants to --
he has questions.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.538 line:92%
And I'll tell you, folks,

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:41.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's actually
when I lose my innocence.

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:45.044 size:75% position:38%
Not earlier that day
when I found mother

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:47.413 line:92%
in three separate hat boxes.

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:48.781 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:52.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
But right then, when he tries
to bond with me.

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:55.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, buddy.
Can I steal a fry?"

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.225 line:92%
That's when I know he's dirty.

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:03.363
That's when I know this thing
goes all the way to the top.

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:06.432 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:07.500 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I don't know. That's --

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.002 line:92%
That's how I like my fries --

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:12.438 line:92%
With a sense of injustice.

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:15.475 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:20.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, you'd be a fool to say
I wasn't wonderful.

00:06:20.179 --> 00:06:21.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you so much.

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:24.884 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:30.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You'd be fool,
an absolute fool.

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:31.124 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Jacqueline Novak!

00:06:31.124 --> 00:06:35.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
